{"id":"claymorphism-soft","title":"Claymorphism — Soft 3D Dashboard","description":"The 2021+ puffy trend — chunky rounded elements in candy colours with double shadows (a coloured drop shadow plus inset highlight/shade), like everything is moulded from soft clay. Great for cute apps and dashboards.","tags":["claymorphism","soft-3d","dashboard"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T19:13:55.058Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Claymorphism — Soft 3D Dashboard\ndescription: The 2021+ puffy trend — chunky rounded elements in candy colours with double shadows (a coloured drop shadow plus inset highlight/shade), like everything is moulded from soft clay. Great for cute apps and dashboards.\ntags: [claymorphism, soft-3d, dashboard]\norder: 21\n---\n\n# Claymorphism — Soft 3D Dashboard\n\nEverything looks hand-moulded from plasticine: oversized radii, chunky padding, and the\nsignature triple shadow — a coloured drop shadow in the element's own hue, plus inset\nlight/shade to give real volume.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Background | pastel gradient lavender `#c9b8ff → #ffd6e8` |\n| Clay cards | pink `#ff9ec4` · mint `#90e0c8` · butter `#ffd166` · violet `#b49cf8` |\n| Clay shadow | `0 22px 44px \u003chue 40%>, inset -10px -10px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.08), inset 10px 10px 22px rgba(255,255,255,.65)` |\n| Radius | 26–34px, chunky 22px padding |\n| Type | system sans, 700-weight |\n\n## Interaction\n\nA working morning-routine dashboard: habit rows toggle with a squish, temperature\nsteppers adjust the clay thermostat, and a clay progress blob fills as habits complete.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Claymorphism — Soft 3D Dashboard\n\nEverything looks hand-moulded from plasticine: oversized radii, chunky padding, and the\nsignature triple shadow — a coloured drop shadow in the element's own hue, plus inset\nlight/shade to give real volume.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Background | pastel gradient lavender `#c9b8ff → #ffd6e8` |\n| Clay cards | pink `#ff9ec4` · mint `#90e0c8` · butter `#ffd166` · violet `#b49cf8` |\n| Clay shadow | `0 22px 44px \u003chue 40%>, inset -10px -10px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.08), inset 10px 10px 22px rgba(255,255,255,.65)` |\n| Radius | 26–34px, chunky 22px padding |\n| Type | system sans, 700-weight |\n\n## Interaction\n\nA working morning-routine dashboard: habit rows toggle with a squish, temperature\nsteppers adjust the clay thermostat, and a clay progress blob fills as habits complete.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>Clayly — Soft 3D Dashboard\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; padding: 44px 20px 70px;\n    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #c9b8ff, #ffd6e8 60%, #fff1c9); color: #4a3f66; }\n  .wrap { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .head { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 34px; }\n  .head h1 { font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 44px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #5a4a8a; }\n  .head p { color: #7a6ba0; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 6px; }\n\n  .clay, .clay-sm { border-radius: 30px; background: #fff; }\n  .clay { padding: 28px; box-shadow: 26px 26px 48px rgba(120, 90, 180, 0.28),\n    inset -10px -10px 22px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06), inset 10px 10px 22px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); }\n  .clay-sm { padding: 20px; border-radius: 26px; }\n\n  .pink { background: #ff9ec4; box-shadow: 22px 22px 44px rgba(230, 90, 150, 0.45), inset -8px -8px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08), inset 8px 8px 18px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7); color: #7c2b52; }\n  .mint { background: #90e0c8; box-shadow: 22px 22px 44px rgba(40, 160, 125, 0.4), inset -8px -8px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07), inset 8px 8px 18px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7); color: #1d6b52; }\n  .butter { background: #ffd166; box-shadow: 22px 22px 44px rgba(220, 160, 40, 0.45), inset -8px -8px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08), inset 8px 8px 18px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); color: #7a5a10; }\n  .violet { background: #b49cf8; box-shadow: 22px 22px 44px rgba(120, 90, 200, 0.4), inset -8px -8px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08), inset 8px 8px 18px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65); color: #3d2b7a; }\n\n  .dash { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; gap: 26px; align-items: start; }\n  @media (max-width: 720px) { .dash { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n\n  .cardtitle { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 18px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }\n  .cardtitle .pct { font-size: 13px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55); padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; }\n\n  .habit { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5); border-radius: 20px; padding: 13px 16px; margin-bottom: 13px; cursor: pointer; transition: transform 0.12s; }\n  .habit:active { transform: scale(0.96); }\n  .habit .em { width: 42px; height: 42px; flex: none; background: #fff; border-radius: 14px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 21px; box-shadow: inset -4px -4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06), inset 4px 4px 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); }\n  .habit .tx { flex: 1; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }\n  .habit .tx small { display: block; font-weight: 500; font-size: 11.5px; opacity: 0.65; }\n  .habit .chk { width: 34px; height: 34px; flex: none; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff; box-shadow: inset 3px 3px 7px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), inset -3px -3px 7px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); display: grid; place-items: center; color: #fff; font-size: 16px; transition: all 0.2s; }\n  .habit.done .chk { background: #5a4a8a; }\n  .habit.done .tx { text-decoration: line-through; opacity: 0.6; }\n  @keyframes squish { 40% { transform: scale(0.9); } }\n\n  .blobbar { height: 22px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5); box-shadow: inset 4px 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08); margin-top: 16px; overflow: hidden; }\n  .blobbar i { display: block; height: 100%; width: 0; border-radius: 999px; background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, #fff3 0 8px, transparent 8px 16px), #5a4a8a; transition: width 0.5s ease; }\n\n  .side { display: grid; gap: 26px; }\n  .temp { text-align: center; }\n  .temp .deg { font-size: 44px; font-weight: 800; margin: 10px 0 4px; }\n  .temp .steppers { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 14px; margin-top: 8px; }\n  .temp button { width: 46px; height: 46px; border: 0; border-radius: 16px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; color: inherit; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55); box-shadow: inset -4px -4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08), inset 4px 4px 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8), 4px 4px 10px rgba(120, 90, 180, 0.25); }\n  .temp button:active { box-shadow: inset 4px 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15); }\n  .temp small { display: block; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; opacity: 0.7; }\n\n  .tile-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }\n  .tile-c { border-radius: 24px; padding: 16px 12px; text-align: center; }\n  .tile-c .em { font-size: 26px; }\n  .tile-c .v { font-weight: 800; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 15px; }\n  .tile-c .l { font-size: 10.5px; opacity: 0.7; }\n\n  .switchrow { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }\n  .switchrow .lbl { font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }\n  .sw { width: 62px; height: 34px; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; background: #fff; position: relative; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: inset 4px 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12), inset -4px -4px 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); }\n  .sw i { position: absolute; top: 5px; left: 5px; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ffd166; box-shadow: 3px 3px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), inset -2px -2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12), inset 2px 2px 5px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); transition: left 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.5, 1.6, 0.4, 1), background 0.25s; }\n  .sw.on i { left: 33px; background: #5a4a8a; }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"head\">\n      \u003ch1>Clayly — morning dashboard\u003c/h1>\n      \u003cp>Everything soft. Everything squishy. Click the habits, steer the thermostat.\u003c/p>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"dash\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"clay\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"cardtitle\">Morning routine \u003cspan class=\"pct\" id=\"pct\">1 / 3 done\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv id=\"habits\">\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"blobbar\">\u003ci id=\"blobfill\">\u003c/i>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"side\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"clay-sm violet temp\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"cardtitle\" style=\"margin-bottom:0\">Thermostat\u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"deg\">\u003cspan id=\"deg\">22\u003c/span>°\u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"steppers\">\n            \u003cbutton id=\"minus\">−\u003c/button>\n            \u003cbutton id=\"plus\">+\u003c/button>\n          \u003c/div>\n          \u003csmall id=\"mode\">cosy mode · heating\u003c/small>\n        \u003c/div>\n\n        \u003cdiv class=\"clay-sm pink switchrow\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"lbl\">Studio lights\u003c/span>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"sw on\" id=\"lsw\" aria-label=\"Toggle lights\">\u003ci>\u003c/i>\u003c/button>\n        \u003c/div>\n\n        \u003cdiv class=\"tile-row\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"clay-sm tile-c mint\">\u003cdiv class=\"em\">💧\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"v\">6/8\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">glasses\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"clay-sm tile-c butter\">\u003cdiv class=\"em\">📚\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"v\">24p\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">pages read\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"clay-sm tile-c violet\">\u003cdiv class=\"em\">💪\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"v\">20m\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">stretch\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    // habits\n    const habits = [\n      { em: \"☀️\", tx: \"Wake up at 7\", s: \"no snoozing\", done: true },\n      { em: \"💧\", tx: \"Big glass of water\", s: \"before coffee\", done: false },\n      { em: \"🏃\", tx: \"Morning run\", s: \"around the park\", done: false }\n    ];\n    function renderHabits() {\n      document.getElementById(\"habits\").innerHTML = habits.map((h, i) =>\n        '\u003cdiv class=\"habit' + (h.done ? \" done\" : \"\") + '\" data-i=\"' + i + '\" style=\"animation:squish .3s\">' +\n        '\u003cspan class=\"em\">' + h.em + '\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"tx\">' + h.tx + \"\u003csmall>\" + h.s + \"\u003c/small>\u003c/span>\" +\n        '\u003cspan class=\"chk\">' + (h.done ? \"✓\" : \"\") + \"\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\").join(\"\");\n      document.querySelectorAll(\".habit\").forEach(el => el.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n        habits[+el.dataset.i].done = !habits[+el.dataset.i].done;\n        renderHabits();\n      }));\n      const done = habits.filter(h => h.done).length;\n      document.getElementById(\"pct\").textContent = done + \" / \" + habits.length + \" done\";\n      document.getElementById(\"blobfill\").style.width = (done / habits.length * 100) + \"%\";\n    }\n    renderHabits();\n\n    // thermostat\n    let deg = 22;\n    function renderDeg() {\n      document.getElementById(\"deg\").textContent = deg;\n      document.getElementById(\"mode\").textContent = deg >= 24 ? \"toasty mode · heating\" : deg \u003c= 18 ? \"cool mode · standby\" : \"cosy mode · heating\";\n    }\n    document.getElementById(\"plus\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => { if (deg \u003c 30) { deg++; renderDeg(); } });\n    document.getElementById(\"minus\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => { if (deg > 16) { deg--; renderDeg(); } });\n\n    // lights\n    document.getElementById(\"lsw\").addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      this.classList.toggle(\"on\");\n    });\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}],"preview":{"file":"index.html","html":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\u003cscript>(function(){try{window.localStorage.getItem(\"__probe__\")}catch(e){var s={};var o={getItem:function(k){return k in s?s[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){s[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete s[k]},clear:function(){s={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(s)[i]||null}};Object.defineProperty(o,\"length\",{get:function(){return Object.keys(s).length},configurable:true});try{Object.defineProperty(window,\"localStorage\",{value:o,configurable:true})}catch(e2){}}})();\u003c/script>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>Clayly — Soft 3D Dashboard\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; padding: 44px 20px 70px;\n    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #c9b8ff, #ffd6e8 60%, #fff1c9); color: #4a3f66; }\n  .wrap { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .head { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 34px; }\n  .head h1 { font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 44px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #5a4a8a; }\n  .head p { color: #7a6ba0; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 6px; }\n\n  .clay, .clay-sm { border-radius: 30px; background: #fff; }\n  .clay { padding: 28px; box-shadow: 26px 26px 48px rgba(120, 90, 180, 0.28),\n    inset -10px -10px 22px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06), inset 10px 10px 22px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); }\n  .clay-sm { padding: 20px; border-radius: 26px; }\n\n  .pink { background: #ff9ec4; box-shadow: 22px 22px 44px rgba(230, 90, 150, 0.45), inset -8px -8px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08), inset 8px 8px 18px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7); color: #7c2b52; }\n  .mint { background: #90e0c8; box-shadow: 22px 22px 44px rgba(40, 160, 125, 0.4), inset -8px -8px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07), inset 8px 8px 18px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7); color: #1d6b52; }\n  .butter { background: #ffd166; box-shadow: 22px 22px 44px rgba(220, 160, 40, 0.45), inset -8px -8px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08), inset 8px 8px 18px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); color: #7a5a10; }\n  .violet { background: #b49cf8; box-shadow: 22px 22px 44px rgba(120, 90, 200, 0.4), inset -8px -8px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08), inset 8px 8px 18px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65); color: #3d2b7a; }\n\n  .dash { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; gap: 26px; align-items: start; }\n  @media (max-width: 720px) { .dash { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n\n  .cardtitle { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 18px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }\n  .cardtitle .pct { font-size: 13px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55); padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; }\n\n  .habit { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5); border-radius: 20px; padding: 13px 16px; margin-bottom: 13px; cursor: pointer; transition: transform 0.12s; }\n  .habit:active { transform: scale(0.96); }\n  .habit .em { width: 42px; height: 42px; flex: none; background: #fff; border-radius: 14px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 21px; box-shadow: inset -4px -4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06), inset 4px 4px 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); }\n  .habit .tx { flex: 1; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }\n  .habit .tx small { display: block; font-weight: 500; font-size: 11.5px; opacity: 0.65; }\n  .habit .chk { width: 34px; height: 34px; flex: none; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff; box-shadow: inset 3px 3px 7px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), inset -3px -3px 7px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); display: grid; place-items: center; color: #fff; font-size: 16px; transition: all 0.2s; }\n  .habit.done .chk { background: #5a4a8a; }\n  .habit.done .tx { text-decoration: line-through; opacity: 0.6; }\n  @keyframes squish { 40% { transform: scale(0.9); } }\n\n  .blobbar { height: 22px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5); box-shadow: inset 4px 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08); margin-top: 16px; overflow: hidden; }\n  .blobbar i { display: block; height: 100%; width: 0; border-radius: 999px; background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, #fff3 0 8px, transparent 8px 16px), #5a4a8a; transition: width 0.5s ease; }\n\n  .side { display: grid; gap: 26px; }\n  .temp { text-align: center; }\n  .temp .deg { font-size: 44px; font-weight: 800; margin: 10px 0 4px; }\n  .temp .steppers { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 14px; margin-top: 8px; }\n  .temp button { width: 46px; height: 46px; border: 0; border-radius: 16px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; color: inherit; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55); box-shadow: inset -4px -4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08), inset 4px 4px 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8), 4px 4px 10px rgba(120, 90, 180, 0.25); }\n  .temp button:active { box-shadow: inset 4px 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15); }\n  .temp small { display: block; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; opacity: 0.7; }\n\n  .tile-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }\n  .tile-c { border-radius: 24px; padding: 16px 12px; text-align: center; }\n  .tile-c .em { font-size: 26px; }\n  .tile-c .v { font-weight: 800; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 15px; }\n  .tile-c .l { font-size: 10.5px; opacity: 0.7; }\n\n  .switchrow { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }\n  .switchrow .lbl { font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }\n  .sw { width: 62px; height: 34px; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; background: #fff; position: relative; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: inset 4px 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12), inset -4px -4px 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); }\n  .sw i { position: absolute; top: 5px; left: 5px; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ffd166; box-shadow: 3px 3px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), inset -2px -2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12), inset 2px 2px 5px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); transition: left 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.5, 1.6, 0.4, 1), background 0.25s; }\n  .sw.on i { left: 33px; background: #5a4a8a; }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"head\">\n      \u003ch1>Clayly — morning dashboard\u003c/h1>\n      \u003cp>Everything soft. Everything squishy. Click the habits, steer the thermostat.\u003c/p>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"dash\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"clay\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"cardtitle\">Morning routine \u003cspan class=\"pct\" id=\"pct\">1 / 3 done\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv id=\"habits\">\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"blobbar\">\u003ci id=\"blobfill\">\u003c/i>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"side\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"clay-sm violet temp\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"cardtitle\" style=\"margin-bottom:0\">Thermostat\u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"deg\">\u003cspan id=\"deg\">22\u003c/span>°\u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"steppers\">\n            \u003cbutton id=\"minus\">−\u003c/button>\n            \u003cbutton id=\"plus\">+\u003c/button>\n          \u003c/div>\n          \u003csmall id=\"mode\">cosy mode · heating\u003c/small>\n        \u003c/div>\n\n        \u003cdiv class=\"clay-sm pink switchrow\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"lbl\">Studio lights\u003c/span>\n          \u003cbutton class=\"sw on\" id=\"lsw\" aria-label=\"Toggle lights\">\u003ci>\u003c/i>\u003c/button>\n        \u003c/div>\n\n        \u003cdiv class=\"tile-row\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"clay-sm tile-c mint\">\u003cdiv class=\"em\">💧\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"v\">6/8\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">glasses\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"clay-sm tile-c butter\">\u003cdiv class=\"em\">📚\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"v\">24p\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">pages read\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"clay-sm tile-c violet\">\u003cdiv class=\"em\">💪\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"v\">20m\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">stretch\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    // habits\n    const habits = [\n      { em: \"☀️\", tx: \"Wake up at 7\", s: \"no snoozing\", done: true },\n      { em: \"💧\", tx: \"Big glass of water\", s: \"before coffee\", done: false },\n      { em: \"🏃\", tx: \"Morning run\", s: \"around the park\", done: false }\n    ];\n    function renderHabits() {\n      document.getElementById(\"habits\").innerHTML = habits.map((h, i) =>\n        '\u003cdiv class=\"habit' + (h.done ? \" done\" : \"\") + '\" data-i=\"' + i + '\" style=\"animation:squish .3s\">' +\n        '\u003cspan class=\"em\">' + h.em + '\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"tx\">' + h.tx + \"\u003csmall>\" + h.s + \"\u003c/small>\u003c/span>\" +\n        '\u003cspan class=\"chk\">' + (h.done ? \"✓\" : \"\") + \"\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\").join(\"\");\n      document.querySelectorAll(\".habit\").forEach(el => el.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n        habits[+el.dataset.i].done = !habits[+el.dataset.i].done;\n        renderHabits();\n      }));\n      const done = habits.filter(h => h.done).length;\n      document.getElementById(\"pct\").textContent = done + \" / \" + habits.length + \" done\";\n      document.getElementById(\"blobfill\").style.width = (done / habits.length * 100) + \"%\";\n    }\n    renderHabits();\n\n    // thermostat\n    let deg = 22;\n    function renderDeg() {\n      document.getElementById(\"deg\").textContent = deg;\n      document.getElementById(\"mode\").textContent = deg >= 24 ? \"toasty mode · heating\" : deg \u003c= 18 ? \"cool mode · standby\" : \"cosy mode · heating\";\n    }\n    document.getElementById(\"plus\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => { if (deg \u003c 30) { deg++; renderDeg(); } });\n    document.getElementById(\"minus\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => { if (deg > 16) { deg--; renderDeg(); } });\n\n    // lights\n    document.getElementById(\"lsw\").addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      this.classList.toggle(\"on\");\n    });\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}}